{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.su2_emergence_volume_determinant","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.su2_emergence_volume_determinant","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Matrix.SpecialLinearGroup","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.UnitaryGroup"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.su2_emergence_combined","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.su2_emergence_combined","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/su2_emergence_volume_determinant.lean#L79-L96","doc":"**Corollary**: combining the dagger constraint (`g · gᴴ = 1`, the\nhypothesis of the sibling lemma `su2_emergence_dagger_unitarity`)\nwith the volume constraint (`g.det = 1`), the gauge element lands\nin `SU(2) = U(2) ∩ SL(2)` — membership in\n`Matrix.specialUnitaryGroup (Fin 2) ℂ`, derived through\n`Matrix.mem_specialUnitaryGroup_iff` and\n`Matrix.mem_unitaryGroup_iff` from the two constraints.\n(The U(2) half repeats the sibling's one-step derivation inline\nrather than importing the module, keeping this file verifiable\nstandalone.) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.su2_emergence_gauge_group_special_linear","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.su2_emergence_gauge_group_special_linear","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/su2_emergence_volume_determinant.lean#L64-L77","doc":"**`G ⊆ SL(2)`** ([`lem:su2-emergence-volume-determinant`]).\n\nIf every element `g` of the gauge group `G` (realised as a set of\n`2×2` complex matrices on the fibre `τ(V)`) satisfies the volume\nconstraint `g.det = 1`, then `G` is contained in the image of\n`SL(2)` inside `M₂(ℂ)`.  Derived pointwise from\n`su2_emergence_volume_determinant`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.su2_emergence_volume_determinant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.su2_emergence_volume_determinant","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/su2_emergence_volume_determinant.lean#L47-L62","doc":"**`g ∈ SL(2)` from the volume constraint — archimedean realisation**\n([`lem:su2-emergence-volume-determinant`]).\n\nA `2×2` complex matrix `g` that preserves the volume form on the\nfibre `τ(V) = ℂ²` (i.e. `g.det = 1`, the concrete form of the\nvolume constraint) lies in the special linear group: it is the\nimage of an element of `Matrix.SpecialLinearGroup (Fin 2) ℂ` under\nthe coercion to matrices.  The conclusion is SL(2)-membership\n(existence of the lift), derived from the determinant hypothesis —\nnot a restatement of it. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:lem:su2-emergence-volume-determinant","label":"lem:su2-emergence-volume-determinant","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/su2-emergence-volume-determinant.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}